// Rival company archetypes. Each row names a kind of persistent rival the
// outfit may encounter through contract arcs; the archetype governs which
// arcs it may attach to, which side of the conflict it stands on, and its
// operational doctrine.
// Typed against domain/rival.zig `ArchetypeTable`.
//
//   key           stable identifier (markup-safe)
//   name          display label (markup-safe)
//   doctrine      RivalDoctrine tag name
//   faction_side  which side: "employer" or "enemy"
//   unit_noun     generic unit type label (markup-safe, non-empty)
//   arcs          arc keys this archetype attaches to
//
// All string fields must be markup-safe (no { or control characters).
